### Assign a category to an operation (replace ids with real ones)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1 }

### Clear an operation's category (back to Uncategorized)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": null }

### Assign a category to many operations at once (categoryId null clears it)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/category
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationIds": [1, 2, 3], "categoryId": 1 }

### Set an operation's free-text note (blank or null clears it)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/1/additional-info
Content-Type: application/json

{ "additionalInfo": "weekly shop" }

### Accept the auto-assigned (predicted) category of one operation
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/1/verify

### Accept the predicted categories of many operations
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationIds": [1, 2, 3] }

### Re-index every categorized operation into the category-suggestion search index
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/sync

### Delete selected operations permanently
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationIds": [1, 2, 3] }

### Delete ALL operations (mappings, categories and groups are kept) — cannot be undone
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/v1/bank-statements/operations/all
